Why non-commercial
------------------
The weights were trained on photographs from iNaturalist. Many of those
photographs are licensed CC BY-NC by their contributors. The non-commercial
condition is applied to the weights so that this repository does not offer terms
more permissive than the material the model was derived from.

Attribution for every training and evaluation photograph, including its
individual licence, is recorded in the manifests under manifests/. The
photographs themselves are not redistributed here and remain under their
contributors' own terms.

